[I] Library for serialising LV2 atoms to and from RDF

[T] Sratom is a small library by David Robillard for serializing LV2 atoms.
[T] It reads and writes atoms from and to RDF, allowing them to be converted
[T] between binary and text or stored in a model.

[U] https://gitlab.com/lv2/sratom

[A] Sratom Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

